   "html": "<div class=\"sl-pair\"><svg class=\"sl-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 190\" width=\"250\" height=\"190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"схема дорог\"><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"91\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"91\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"91\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"228\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><g><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"100\">А</text></g><g><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"27\">Б</text></g><g><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"173\">В</text></g><g><circle cx=\"159\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"159\" y=\"100\">Г</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"27\">Д</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"173\">Е</text></g></svg><table class=\"sl-tab sl-adj \"><tr><th></th><th>П1</th><th>П2</th><th>П3</th><th>П4</th><th>П5</th><th>П6</th></tr><tr><th>П1</th><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">11</td></tr><tr><th>П2</th><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">12</td></tr><tr><th>П3</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">14</td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П4</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">9</td></tr><tr><th>П5</th><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">14</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П6</th><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"sl-cols\"><div><h4>На схеме</h4><p>Считаем линии у каждой буквы. <b>А</b> — 2 · <b>Б</b> — 3 · <b>В</b> — 3 · <b>Г</b> — 4 · <b>Д</b> — 2 · <b>Е</b> — 2</p></div>\n<div><h4>В таблице</h4><p>Считаем заполненные клетки в строке. <b>П1</b> — 4 · <b>П2</b> — 3 · <b>П3</b> — 2 · <b>П4</b> — 2 · <b>П5</b> — 2 · <b>П6</b> — 3</p></div></div>"
