   "h": "Python: перебор всех соответствий",
   "ch": "Задание и программа",
   "cond": "<svg class=\"sl-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 190\" width=\"250\" height=\"190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"схема дорог\"><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"176\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><g><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"27\">А</text></g><g><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"27\">Б</text></g><g><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"100\">В</text></g><g><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"173\">Г</text></g><g><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"173\">Д</text></g><g><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"100\">Е</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"100\">К</text></g></svg><table class=\"sl-tab sl-adj sm\"><tr><th></th><th>П1</th><th>П2</th><th>П3</th><th>П4</th><th>П5</th><th>П6</th><th>П7</th></tr><tr><th>П1</th><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">5</td></tr><tr><th>П2</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П3</th><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">9</td></tr><tr><th>П4</th><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П5</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П6</th><td class=\"\">7</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П7</th><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td></tr></table><p><b>Определите длину дороги между пунктами В и Д.</b></p>",
   "note": "Программа перебирает все способы сопоставить буквы и номера и оставляет те, где каждая дорога схемы есть в таблице. Так можно проверить любой ответ, решённый руками.",
   "nk": "secret",
   "code": "from itertools import permutations\n# дороги на схеме\nschema = 'АБ АВ АГ БВ БЕ ВГ ВД ДЕ ЕК'.split()\n# дороги в таблице: (строка, столбец): длина\ntable = {\n    (1, 3): 6, (1, 4): 8, (1, 6): 7, (1, 7): 5,\n    (2, 4): 10, (2, 5): 15, (2, 6): 12,\n    (3, 6): 11, (3, 7): 9,\n}\n\ndef road(a, b):\n    return table.get((a, b)) or table.get((b, a))\n\nletters = sorted(set(''.join(schema)))\nanswers = set()\nfor p in permutations(range(1, len(letters) + 1)):\n    num = dict(zip(letters, p))   # буква → номер\n    if all(road(num[x], num[y]) for x, y in schema):\n        answers.add(road(num['В'], num['Д']))\nprint(*answers)",
   "ans": "8",
   "stack": true
  },
