   "cond": "<svg class=\"sl-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 190\" width=\"250\" height=\"190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"схема дорог\"><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"74\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"176\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"176\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"74\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"176\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><g><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"100\">А</text></g><g><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"27\">Б</text></g><g><circle cx=\"74\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"173\">В</text></g><g><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"100\">Г</text></g><g><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"27\">Д</text></g><g><circle cx=\"176\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"176\" y=\"173\">Е</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"100\">Ж</text></g></svg><table class=\"sl-tab sl-adj sm\"><tr><th></th><th>П1</th><th>П2</th><th>П3</th><th>П4</th><th>П5</th><th>П6</th><th>П7</th></tr><tr><th>П1</th><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\">14</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П2</th><td class=\"\">14</td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П3</th><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П4</th><td class=\"\">15</td><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\">16</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\">11</td></tr><tr><th>П5</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">13</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">16</td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">8</td></tr><tr><th>П6</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">10</td><td class=\"\">6</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П7</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">8</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td></tr></table><p><b>Определите сумму длин дорог Б–Г и Е–Ж.</b></p>",
   "note": "Г — единственный с пятью дорогами. А у А, Б и Д — по три, различаем по соседям: только у Б <b>два</b> соседа с тремя дорогами (А и Д). Е — сосед Г с двумя дорогами, связанный с Ж; у В второй сосед — А. Ответ: 19.",
   "nk": "warn",
   "code": "from itertools import permutations\n# дороги на схеме\nschema = 'АБ АВ АГ БГ ВГ ГД ГЕ ДЖ ЕЖ БД'.split()\n# дороги в таблице: (строка, столбец): длина\ntable = {\n    (1, 2): 14, (1, 3): 12, (1, 4): 15,\n    (2, 4): 9, (2, 5): 13,\n    (3, 6): 10,\n    (4, 5): 16, (4, 6): 6, (4, 7): 11,\n    (5, 7): 8,\n}\n\ndef road(a, b):\n    return table.get((a, b)) or table.get((b, a))\n\nletters = sorted(set(''.join(schema)))\nanswers = set()\nfor p in permutations(range(1, len(letters) + 1)):\n    num = dict(zip(letters, p))   # буква → номер\n    if all(road(num[x], num[y]) for x, y in schema):\n        answers.add(road(num['Б'], num['Г']) + road(num['Е'], num['Ж']))\nprint(*answers)",
   "ans": "19",
   "stack": true
