   "kc": "t2",
   "h": "Кратчайший путь из А в Е",
   "ch": "Задание",
   "cond": "<svg class=\"sl-graph\" viewBox=\"0 0 250 190\" width=\"250\" height=\"190\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"схема дорог\"><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"91\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"91\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"95\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"91\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"22\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"228\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"168\" class=\"\"/><g><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"100\">А</text></g><g><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"27\">Б</text></g><g><circle cx=\"91\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"91\" y=\"173\">В</text></g><g><circle cx=\"159\" cy=\"95\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"159\" y=\"100\">Г</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"22\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"27\">Д</text></g><g><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"168\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"228\" y=\"173\">Е</text></g></svg><table class=\"sl-tab sl-adj sm\"><tr><th></th><th>П1</th><th>П2</th><th>П3</th><th>П4</th><th>П5</th><th>П6</th></tr><tr><th>П1</th><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">9</td></tr><tr><th>П2</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\">5</td></tr><tr><th>П3</th><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\"></td></tr><tr><th>П4</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">3</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">11</td></tr><tr><th>П5</th><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">12</td><td class=\"\">4</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"x\"></td><td class=\"\">2</td></tr><tr><th>П6</th><td class=\"\">9</td><td class=\"\">5</td><td class=\"\"></td><td class=\"\">11</td><td class=\"\">2</td><td class=\"x\"></td></tr></table><p><b>Определите длину кратчайшего пути из пункта А в пункт Е.</b> Передвигаться можно только по указанным дорогам.</p>",
   "note": "Прямой дороги А–Е нет. Путь А–Б–Г–Е = 4 + 2 + 11 = 17, но в обход через Д короче: А–Б–Г–Д–Е = 4 + 2 + 5 + 3 = 14.",
   "nk": "warn",
   "code": "from itertools import permutations\n# дороги на схеме\nschema = 'АБ АВ БГ ВГ БД ГД ГЕ ДЕ'.split()\n# дороги в таблице: (строка, столбец): длина\ntable = {\n    (1, 3): 3, (1, 6): 9,\n    (2, 4): 3, (2, 5): 12, (2, 6): 5,\n    (3, 5): 4,\n    (4, 6): 11,\n    (5, 6): 2,\n}\n\ndef road(a, b):\n    return table.get((a, b)) or table.get((b, a))\n\nletters = sorted(set(''.join(schema)))\n\ndef shortest(a, b, seen=()):\n    \"\"\"Кратчайший путь из a в b (номера пунктов).\"\"\"\n    if a == b:\n        return 0\n    best = None\n    for c in range(1, len(letters) + 1):\n        if c not in seen and road(a, c):\n            rest = shortest(c, b, seen + (a,))\n            if rest is not None:\n                d = road(a, c) + rest\n                if best is None or d < best:\n                    best = d\n    return best\n\nanswers = set()\nfor p in permutations(range(1, len(letters) + 1)):\n    num = dict(zip(letters, p))   # буква → номер\n    if all(road(num[x], num[y]) for x, y in schema):\n        answers.add(shortest(num['А'], num['Е']))\nprint(*answers)",
   "ans": "14",
   "stack": true
  },
